<title>JAPAN: JR East hit by JR West listing jitters.</title>
<headline>JR East hit by JR West listing jitters.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in East Japan Railway Co were lower by Monday late morning, hit by jitters from the scheduled listing of West Japan Railways Co, which is due to take place on Tuesday, brokers said.</p>
<p>The shares were down 8,000 yen at 527,000 yen just before the midday close.</p>
<p>For most of last week, JR East had posted modest gains as investors bought the shares in order to provide support for the listing of JR West, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;Some of those investors are having second thoughts now and they are starting to sell,&quot; one broker said.</p>
</text>
